cale\" data-en=\"Measurement Scales\">Measurement Scales</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-structures-and-formats\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-structures-and-formats/\"><span>08</span><span data-bn=\"Structured, Semi-structured ও Unstructured Data\" data-en=\"Structured, Semi-structured, and Unstructured Data\">Structured, Semi-structured, and Unstructured Data</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-sources-and-collection\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-sources-and-collection/\"><span>09</span><span data-bn=\"Data Source ও Collection Method\" data-en=\"Data Sources and Collection Methods\">Data Sources and Collection Methods</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"population-sample-parameter-and-statistic\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/population-sample-parameter-and-statistic/\"><span>10</span><span data-bn=\"Population, Sample, Parameter ও Statistic\" data-en=\"Population, Sample, Parameter, and Statistic\">Population, Sample, Parameter, and Statistic</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"sampling-methods\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/sampling-methods/\"><span>11</span><span data-bn=\"Sampling Method\" data-en=\"Sampling Methods\">Sampling Methods</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"bias-confounding-and-error\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/bias-confounding-and-error/\"><span>12</span><span data-bn=\"Bias, Confounding ও Error\" data-en=\"Bias, Confounding, and Error\">Bias, Confounding, and Error</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-quality-dimensions\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-quality-dimensions/\"><span>13</span><span data-bn=\"Data Quality Dimension\" data-en=\"Data Quality Dimensions\">Data Quality Dimensions</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"missing-duplicate-invalid-and-outlier-values\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/missing-duplicate-invalid-and-outlier-values/\"><span>14</span><span data-bn=\"Missing, Duplicate, Invalid ও Outlier Value\" data-en=\"Missing, Duplicate, Invalid, and Outlier Values\">Missing, Duplicate, Invalid, and Outlier Values</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"tidy-data-and-organization\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/tidy-data-and-organization/\"><span>15</span><span data-bn=\"Tidy Data ও Data Organization\" data-en=\"Tidy Data and Data Organization\">Tidy Data and Data Organization</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"frequency-tables-and-summary-views\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/frequency-tables-and-summary-views/\"><span>16</span><span data-bn=\"Frequency Table ও Summary View\" data-en=\"Frequency Tables and Summary Views\">Frequency Tables and Summary Views</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"analytical-questions-and-metrics\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/analytical-questions-and-metrics/\"><span>17</span><span data-bn=\"Analytical Question ও Metric Definition\" data-en=\"Analytical Questions and Defining Metrics\">Analytical Questions and Defining Metrics</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"exploratory-data-analysis-workflow\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/exploratory-data-analysis-workflow/\"><span>18</span><span data-bn=\"Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow\" data-en=\"Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow\">Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"reproducible-analysis-and-documentation\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/reproducible-analysis-and-documentation/\"><span>19</span><span data-bn=\"Reproducible Analysis ও Documentation\" data-en=\"Reproducible Analysis and Documentation\">Reproducible Analysis and Documentation</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-ethics-privacy-and-responsible-use\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-ethics-privacy-and-responsible-use/\"><span>20</span><span data-bn=\"Data Ethics, Privacy ও Responsible Use\" data-en=\"Data Ethics, Privacy, and Responsible Use\">Data Ethics, Privacy, and Responsible Use</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link current\" data-chapter-link=\"mini-project-retail-data-audit\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/mini-project-retail-data-audit/\"><span>21</span><span data-bn=\"Mini Project: Retail Dataset Audit\" data-en=\"Mini Project: Audit a Retail Dataset\">Mini Project: Audit a Retail Dataset</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a></div></nav>\n<div class=\"tutorial-sidebar-links\"><a href=\"/exercises/data-foundations/\">Exercises</a><a href=\"/quiz/data-foundations/\">Final quiz</a><a href=\"/examples/data-foundations/\">Examples</a><a href=\"/references/data-foundations/\">References</a></div>\n</aside>\n<div class=\"tutorial-drawer-backdrop\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-backdrop\"></div>\n<article class=\"tutorial-content\" data-chapter=\"mini-project-retail-data-audit\" data-tutorial=\"data-foundations\">\n<header class=\"tutorial-page-header\"><div>\n<span class=\"eyebrow\" data-bn=\"Data Foundations · Chapter 21 / 21\" data-en=\"Data Foundations · Chapter 21 of 21\">Data Foundations · Chapter 21 of 21</span>\n<h1 data-bn=\"Mini Project: Retail Dataset Audit\" data-en=\"Mini Project: Audit a Retail Dataset\">Mini Project: Audit a Retail Dataset</h1>\n<p class=\"tutorial-lead\" data-bn=\"Documented retail-sales CSV-তে পুরো Data Foundations tutorial apply করুন। Question define, structure inspect, quality profile, finding organize ও responsible analytical brief লিখুন।\" data-en=\"Apply the entire Data Foundations tutorial to a documented retail-sales CSV. Define questions, inspect structure, profile quality, organize findings, and write a responsible analytical brief.\">Apply the entire Data Foundations tutorial to a documented retail-sales CSV. Define questions, inspect structure, profile quality, organize findings, and write a responsible analytical brief.</p>\n</div><div class=\"tutorial-header-actions\"><button class=\"button ghost tutorial-drawer-open\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-open\" type=\"button\">☰ <span data-bn=\"Chapter\" data-en=\"Chapters\">Chapters</span></button><button class=\"button ghost\" onclick=\"window.print()\" type=\"button\">⎙ <span data-bn=\"Print\" data-en=\"Print\">Print</span></button></div></header>\n<div class=\"chapter-meta\"><span>◷ 90 min</span><span>Beginner</span><button class=\"button small primary\" id=\"chapter-complete\" type=\"button\">Mark complete</button></div>\n<nav aria-label=\"On this chapter\" class=\"chapter-jump\"><a href=\"#objectives\">Objectives</a><a href=\"#concept-1\">Learn</a><a href=\"#worked-example\">Example</a><a href=\"#try-it\">Try it</a><a href=\"#exercises\">Exercises</a><a href=\"#summary\">Summary</a></nav>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section tutorial-objectives\" id=\"objectives\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Start here</div><h2 data-bn=\"আপনি যা শিখবেন\" data-en=\"What you will learn\">What you will learn</h2><ul><li><span data-bn=\"Question থেকে documented finding পর্যন্ত dataset audit করুন।\" data-en=\"Audit a dataset from question to documented findings.\">Audit a dataset from question to documented findings.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Structure, type, quality ও ethics check apply করুন।\" data-en=\"Apply structure, type, quality, and ethics checks.\">Apply structure, type, quality, and ethics checks.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Concise data-readiness report তৈরি করুন।\" data-en=\"Produce a concise data-readiness report.\">Produce a concise data-readiness report.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Future Excel, SQL, Power BI ও Python work-এর জন্য dataset prepare করুন।\" data-en=\"Prepare the dataset for future Excel, SQL, Power BI, and Python work.\">Prepare the dataset for future Excel, SQL, Power BI, and Python work.</span></li></ul></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-1\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">01</div><h2 data-bn=\"Project brief\" data-en=\"Project brief\">Project brief</h2><p data-bn=\"আপনি retail manager-কে month, region, channel ও product category অনুযায়ী sales performance বুঝতে support করছেন। Analysis-এর আগে synthetic dataset structurally ও analytically ready কি না determine করতে হবে।\" data-en=\"You are supporting a retail manager who wants to understand sales performance by month, region, channel, and product category. Before analysis, you must determine whether the provided synthetic dataset is structurally and analytically ready.\">You are supporting a retail manager who wants to understand sales performance by month, region, channel, and product category. Before analysis, you must determine whether the provided synthetic dataset is structurally and analytically ready.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-2\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">02</div><h2 data-bn=\"Required audit\" data-en=\"Required audit\">Required audit</h2><p data-bn=\"Row grain, key field, data type, time coverage, source assumption ও target question document করুন। Row count, duplicate key, missing required value, invalid category, impossible quantity, arithmetic consistency ও extreme revenue/profit profile করুন।\" data-en=\"Document the row grain, key fields, data types, time coverage, source assumptions, and target questions. Profile row count, duplicate keys, missing required values, invalid categories, impossible quantities, arithmetic consistency, and extreme revenue or profit values.\">Document the row grain, key fields, data types, time coverage, source assumptions, and target questions. Profile row count, duplicate keys, missing required values, invalid categories, impossible quantities, arithmetic consistency, and extreme revenue or profit values.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-3\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">03</div><h2 data-bn=\"Analytical summary\" data-en=\"Analytical summary\">Analytical summary</h2><p data-bn=\"Quality check-এর পর total revenue, total profit, order count, median order value, monthly trend, top category, regional contribution ও loss-making observation calculate করুন। Business finding data-quality finding থেকে আলাদা রাখুন।\" data-en=\"After quality checks, calculate a small set of descriptive outputs: total revenue, total profit, order count, median order value, monthly trend, top categories, regional contribution, and loss-making observations. Keep business findings separate from data-quality findings.\">After quality checks, calculate a small set of descriptive outputs: total revenue, total profit, order count, median order value, monthly trend, top categories, regional contribution, and loss-making observations. Keep business findings separate from data-quality findings.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-4\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">04</div><h2 data-bn=\"Deliverable\" data-en=\"Deliverable\">Deliverable</h2><p data-bn=\"এক-page data-readiness brief: question, dataset scope, grain, quality scorecard, তিন evidence-based finding, এক limitation, এক recommended next analysis ও change log। Cleaned file original থেকে separately save করুন।\" data-en=\"Produce a one-page data-readiness brief with: question, dataset scope, grain, quality scorecard, three evidence-based findings, one limitation, one recommended next analysis, and a change log. Save any cleaned file separately from the original.\">Produce a one-page data-readiness brief with: question, dataset scope, grain, quality scorecard, three evidence-based findings, one limitation, one recommended next analysis, and a change log. Save any cleaned file separately from the original.</p></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section key-terms\" id=\"key-terms\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Vocabulary</div><h2 data-bn=\"গুরুত্বপূর্ণ শব্দ\" data-en=\"Key terms\">Key terms</h2><div class=\"term-grid\"><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Data audit\" data-en=\"Data audit\">Data audit</h3><p data-bn=\"Structure, quality, provenance ও fitness-for-use-এর documented review।\" data-en=\"A documented review of structure, quality, provenance, and fitness for use.\">A documented review of structure, quality, provenance, and fitness for use.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Readiness\" data-en=\"Readiness\">Readiness</h3><p data-bn=\"Defined analytical purpose safely support করার degree।\" data-en=\"The degree to which data can safely support a defined analytical purpose.\">The degree to which data can safely support a defined analytical purpose.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Quality scorecard\" data-en=\"Quality scorecard\">Quality scorecard</h3><p data-bn=\"Check, failure, severity ও action-এর concise report।\" data-en=\"A concise report of checks, failures, severity, and action.\">A concise report of checks, failures, severity, and action.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Change log\" data-en=\"Change log\">Change log</h3><p data-bn=\"Data-তে applied transformation ও correction-এর record।\" data-en=\"A record of transformations and corrections applied to data.\">A record of transformations and corrections applied to data.</p></article></div></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section worked-example\" id=\"worked-example\">\n<div class=\"section-kicker\">Example</div><h2 data-bn=\"Suggested project workflow\" data-en=\"Suggested project workflow\">Suggested project workflow</h2><p class=\"example-context\" data-bn=\"Included retail_sales.csv ও data dictionary ব্যবহার করুন।\" data-en=\"Use the included retail_sales.csv and data dictionary.\">Use the included retail_sales.csv and data dictionary.</p>\n<ol class=\"worked-steps\"><li><span>1</span><p data-bn=\"Project brief পড়ে তিন analytical question লিখুন।\" data-en=\"Read the project brief and write three analytical questions.\">Read the project brief and write three analytical questions.</p></li><li><span>2</span><p data-bn=\"Data dictionary inspect করে one-row meaning confirm করুন।\" data-en=\"Inspect the data dictionary and confirm one-row meaning.\">Inspect the data dictionary and confirm one-row meaning.</p></li><li><span>3</span><p data-bn=\"KPI calculate-এর আগে structure ও quality profile করুন।\" data-en=\"Profile structure and quality before calculating KPIs.\">Profile structure and quality before calculating KPIs.</p></li><li><span>4</span><p data-bn=\"Summary table ও একটি trend chart তৈরি করুন।\" data-en=\"Create summary tables and one trend chart.\">Create summary tables and one trend chart.</p></li><li><span>5</span><p data-bn=\"কমপক্ষে একটি unusual value investigate করুন।\" data-en=\"Investigate at least one unusual value.\">Investigate at least one unusual value.</p></li><li><span>6</span><p data-bn=\"Unit, time period ও limitation-সহ finding লিখুন।\" data-en=\"Write findings with units, time period, and limitations.\">Write findings with units, time period, and limitations.</p></li><li><span>7</span><p data-bn=\"README ও change log save করুন।\" data-en=\"Save a README and change log.\">Save a README and change log.</p></li></ol>\n<div class=\"example-conclusion\"><strong data-bn=\"Conclusion\" data-en=\"Conclusion\">Conclusion</strong><p data-bn=\"অন্য learner আপনার question বুঝতে, audit repeat এবং প্রতিটি conclusion evidence-এ trace করতে পারলে project complete।\" data-en=\"The project is complete when another learner can understand your question, repeat the audit, and trace each conclusion to evidence.\">The project is complete when another learner can understand your question, repeat the audit, and trace each conclusion to evidence.</p></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section try-it-section\" id=\"try-it\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Try it yourself</div><h2 data-bn=\"ধারণাটি প্র্যাকটিস করুন\" data-en=\"Practice the idea\">Practice the idea</h2><div id=\"tutorial-activity\"></div></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section exercise-section\" id=\"exercises\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Check yourself</div><h2 data-bn=\"Chapter exercise\" data-en=\"Chapter exercises\">Chapter exercises</h2><div id=\"chapter-exercises\"></div><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/exercises/data-foundations/\">Open the complete exercise library →</a></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section recap-section\" id=\"summary\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Summary</div><h2 data-bn=\"যা মনে রাখবেন\" data-en=\"What to remember\">What to remember</h2><ul><li><span data-bn=\"Calculate-এর আগে question define করুন।\" data-en=\"Define questions before calculating.\">Define questions before calculating.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Business interpretation-এর আগে structure ও quality audit করুন।\" data-en=\"Audit structure and quality before business interpretation.\">Audit structure and quality before business interpretation.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Quality finding ও business finding আলাদা করুন।\" data-en=\"Separate quality findings from business findings.\">Separate quality findings from business findings.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Raw data preserve ও change document করুন।\" data-en=\"Preserve raw data and document changes.\">Preserve raw data and document changes.</span></li></ul></section>\n<details class=\"tutorial-references\"><summary>Authoritative references</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/eda/eda_d.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">NIST/SEMATECH — Exploratory Data Analysis ↗</a></li><li><a href=\"https://unstats.un.org/UNSDWebsite/data-quality\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">United Nations Statistics Division — Data Quality ↗</a></li><li><a href=\"https://nvlpubs.nist.gov/nistpubs/SpecialPublications/1500-18/NIST.SP.1500-18r2.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">NIST Research Data Framework ↗</a></li></ul></details>\n<div class=\"tutorial-complete-panel\"><div><h2 data-bn=\"পরবর্তী chapter-এর জন্য প্রস্তুত?\" data-en=\"Ready for the next chapter?\">Ready for the next chapter?</h2><p data-bn=\"ধারণাটি explain ও exercise finish করতে পারলে chapter complete mark করুন।\" data-en=\"Mark this chapter complete after you can explain the idea and finish the exercises.\">Mark this chapter complete after you can explain the idea and finish the exercises.</p></div><button class=\"button primary\" id=\"chapter-complete-bottom\" type=\"button\">Mark complete</button></div>\n<nav class=\"tutorial-pager\"><a class=\"tutorial-prev\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-ethics-privacy-and-responsible-use/\"><small>← Previous</small><strong data-bn=\"Data Ethics, Privacy ও Responsible Use\" data-en=\"Data Ethics, Privacy, and Responsible Use\">Data Ethics, Privacy, and Responsible Use</strong></a><a class=\"tutorial-next\" href=\"/quiz/data-foundations/\"><small>Finish →</small><strong>Final Quiz</strong></a></nav>\n</article>\n</div></main>","scripts":["/assets/js/tutorial-core.js","/assets/js/tutorial.js"],"inlineScripts":[]}